{"v":4,"catch":"解開謎題，解開隱藏在Krystopia美麗宇宙中的神秘面紗。","desc":"Krystopia 是一款密室逃脫遊戲，通過引人入勝的激光謎題、機器人和隱藏物品來挑戰和吸引你。跟隨Nova Dune，一個太空探險家，去尋找她在飛船上收到的陌生的求救信號。她決心調查它，發現自己在一個荒蕪的星球上，所有的文明都已經消失了。 \n\n特點\n\n精心設計的謎題\n身臨其境的遊戲玩法\n探索\n環境故事\n配音敘事","publisher":"GODSPEED GAMES","release":"2021-12-02","genres":["益智","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/94763f5c8716cfd8eb2a3678f894dc352f8490b9835f4d29e474cb6c5a24dda0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0c890cb3ed7dd8b7a70dbf21750e1623257965311dddf944d5d8bdae282a528.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ae9e58c2c7b68958320750828aca9e3f71aaa0ad8821efa57d4381bd64b77f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/777475fa1610588091e74ac9acadb7e39a8798b3dd488e164269908de70ce24b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e8214359231e435b1047ee0fb84384dd010139626b7c06ef16ffc77e7de683d3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9140feff9886af64c65be820f01b30bc421404023b296a4849f62250429323a3.jpg"],"titleId":"0100971011afc000","dlc":[]}